#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:480
msgid "Search engines"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:481
msgid "Let search engines through (Google, Bing, Apple, DuckDuckGo, Yandex)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:482
msgid "Verified by reverse DNS, so bots that only pretend to be Googlebot are not let through. Results are cached for a day."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:483
msgid "Let through by user agent"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:485
msgid "One per line, part of the user agent, for monitoring or feeds you rely on. User agents are easy to fake, so keep this list short. Paths are excluded in \"Never protect\" above."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:491
msgid "Log"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-powned-settings.php:492
msgid "Pages the lockdown would have challenged (requests without a solved block), most frequent first. Look for pages that machines must reach, and add them to \"Never protect\"."
msgstr ""

